#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/hpe-arubacx-dss.rst:2
msgid "HPE Aruba CX DSS"
msgstr "HPE Aruba CX DSS"

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/hpe-arubacx-dss.rst:5
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Descripción general"

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/hpe-arubacx-dss.rst:6
msgid ""
"The HPE Aruba CX DSS plugin brings advanced networking features to "
"|morphfirst| by leveraging Aruba CX 10000 series switches. It supports both "
"micro-segmentation and macro-segmentation, integrating seamlessly with HPE "
"and Aruba technologies to improve user experience and operational "
"efficiency."
msgstr ""
"The HPE Aruba CX DSS plugin brings advanced networking características to "
"|morphfirst| by leveraging Aruba CX 10000 series switches. It supports both "
"micro-segmentation y macro-segmentation, integrating seamlessly con HPE y "
"Aruba technologies to improve user experience y operational efficiency."

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/hpe-arubacx-dss.rst:8
msgid ""
"Implemented as a |morpheus| ``NetworkProvider`` in Groovy, the plugin is "
"purpose-built for the HPE Aruba Networking Distributed Services Switch "
"network type (HPE ANW DSS Port Group) and optimized for |morpheus| "
"environments. It automates the creation and management of networks for HPE "
"ANW DSS Port Groups, connecting servers to Aruba CX 10000 switches within a "
"|cluster|."
msgstr ""
"Implemented as un |morpheus| ``NetworkProvider`` in Groovy, el plugin es "
"purpose-built para el HPE Aruba Networking Distributed Services Switch "
"network tipo (HPE ANW DSS Port Group) y optimized para |morpheus| entornos. "
"It automates el creation y management of networks para HPE ANW DSS Port "
"Groups, connecting servers to Aruba CX 10000 switches dentro de un "
"|cluster|."

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/hpe-arubacx-dss.rst:10
msgid ""
"On each host, the plugin creates Linux bridge interfaces and associates them"
" with VLANs for streamlined network management and configuration. |morpheus|"
" integrates directly with Aruba Fabric Composer (AFC) to automatically "
"create or delete networks for HPE ANW DSS Port Groups as they are added to "
"or removed from a configured cluster. Adding or removing |hosts| in the "
"|cluster| triggers the corresponding network changes in AFC, ensuring the "
"network configurations are always up to date."
msgstr ""
"On cada host, el plugin creates Linux bridge interfaces y associates them "
"con VLANs para streamlined network management y configuración. |morpheus| "
"integrates directly con Aruba Fabric Composer (AFC) to automáticamente "
"create o delete networks para HPE ANW DSS Port Groups as they son agregado "
"to o eliminado desde un configurado cluster. Adding o removing |hosts| in el"
" |cluster| triggers el corresponding network cambios in AFC, ensuring la red"
" configurations son always up to date."

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/hpe-arubacx-dss.rst:12
msgid ""
"The plugin also enables the creation of networks with specific VLAN IDs, "
"supporting flexible segmentation and isolation. When a network is created, "
"the plugin provisions the required VLANs on the Aruba CX 10000 switches, "
"ensuring networks are ready for use by Instances within the |cluster|."
msgstr ""
"The plugin también enables el creation of networks con específico VLAN IDs, "
"supporting flexible segmentation y isolation. When una red es creado, el "
"plugin provisions el requerido VLANs on el Aruba CX 10000 switches, ensuring"
" networks son ready para use by Instances dentro de el |cluster|."

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/hpe-arubacx-dss.rst:14
msgid ""
"Additionally, the plugin creates a Libvirt network of type Private. When an "
"Instance is created on the host and associated with this network, a macvtap "
"interface is generated and mapped to the corresponding Linux Interface VLAN "
"ID, ensuring seamless connectivity and isolation."
msgstr ""
"Adicionalmente, el plugin creates un Libvirt network of tipo Private. When "
"un Instance es creado on el host y asociado con esta red, un macvtap "
"interfaz es generated y mapped to el corresponding Linux Interface VLAN ID, "
"ensuring seamless connectivity y isolation."

